gy.",["Date","2023-11-22T00:00:00.000Z"],[18,19,20],"Vue","Nuxt","Firebase","## About Stoor\r\n\r\nStoor is a project close to my heart. It explores how we can use technology to preserve and share stories in a way that feels authentic and personal.\r\n\r\n### Key Features\r\n\r\n*   **Audio-first**: Stories are recorded and played back, emphasizing the voice.\r\n*   **Community-driven**: Users can contribute their own stories to the collection.\r\n*   **Interactive Map**: Stories are geotagged, allowing users to discover narratives based on location.\r\n\r\n### Technical Details\r\n\r\nBuilt with **Nuxt 3** and **Firebase**, Stoor leverages server-side rendering for SEO and performance, while providing a reactive real-time experience for users.","src/content/software/stoor.md","e8ab19dcd95cb89a",{"html":25,"metadata":26},"\u003Ch2 id=\"about-stoor\">About Stoor\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Stoor is a project close to my heart. It explores how we can use technology to preserve and share stories in a way that feels authentic and personal.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"key-features\">Key Features\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Audio-first\u003C/strong>: Stories are recorded and played back, emphasizing the voice.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Community-driven\u003C/strong>: Users can contribute their own stories to the collection.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Interactive Map\u003C/strong>: Stories are geotagged, allowing users to discover narratives based on location.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"technical-details\">Technical Details\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Built with \u003Cstrong>Nuxt 3\u003C/strong> and \u003Cstrong>Firebase\u003C/strong>, Stoor leverages server-side rendering for SEO and performance, while providing a reactive real-time experience for users.\u003C/p>",{"headings":27,"localImagePaths":39,"remoteImagePaths":40,"frontmatter":41,"imagePaths":44},[28,32,36],{"depth":29,"slug":30,"text":31},2,"about-stoor","About Stoor",{"depth":33,"slug":34,"text"